Everyone not invited to Los Angeles will get to see the product announcements via press releases that come out on October 28. Apple could send out press releases at 10:00 a.m. Pacific Time, which is when the media experience will begin. Press release announcements typically come out earlier in the morning around 9:00 a.m. Eastern Time, so that's also a possibility.<br/>
<br/>
The "Pro and Tell" name gives us a strong hint at what's coming: the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macbook-pro/">MacBook Pro</a>. It will be joined by other new Macs and a new <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad/">iPad</a>.<br/>
